# Ear-check audio: regenerable from calibration/ear-check/clip.txt via the
# command in that directory's README. The instrument (text + interpretation)
# is committed; the 1MB WAV is not, since this repo may be made public and the
# file is reproducible byte-for-byte from a pinned engine hash.
calibration/ear-check/*.wav
